{
  "info": {
    "name": "Profile Service – Payment Forms",
    "description": "Standing order, salary deduction, and SEPA direct debit forms.\n\n**Portal** (`/api/payment-forms/portal`): member save/load/submit.\n**CRM** (`/api/payment-forms`): staff workflows.\n\nSet `baseUrl` (e.g. `http://localhost:4002` or `https://host/profile-service`) and `authToken` (Bearer JWT with portal or CRM permissions).\n\nAfter **Create draft**, the response `_id` is saved to `paymentFormId`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:4002", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "authToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "profileId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "paymentFormId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "formType", "value": "STANDING_ORDER", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Portal",
      "description": "Member portal APIs. Profile is resolved from the authenticated portal user.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List my forms",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/payment-forms/portal/mine",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "payment-forms", "portal", "mine"]
            },
            "description": "Returns submitted/active/portal-visible forms. Drafts are loaded by id after create."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Prefill (preview creditor details, not saved)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/payment-forms/portal/prefill?formType={{formType}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "payment-forms", "portal", "prefill"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "formType", "value": "{{formType}}", "description": "STANDING_ORDER | DD_MANDATE | SALARY_DEDUCTION. Omit to auto-resolve from current subscription." }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Resolves the portal member's profile from the token and returns a hydrated form preview – including creditor/beneficiary block from the tenant's organisationProfile – without persisting a draft.\n\nUse before the portal user submits, so the form shows creditor details (name, identifier, address, IBAN/BIC) up-front.\n\n**Response shape (DD_MANDATE):**\n`paymentForm.directDebitMandate.creditorName | creditorIdentifier | creditorAddress | creditorCity | creditorPostcode | creditorCountry | creditorIban | creditorBic`\n\n**Response shape (STANDING_ORDER):**\n`paymentForm.standingOrder.beneficiaryAccountName | beneficiaryBankName | beneficiaryAddress | beneficiaryIban | beneficiaryBic | beneficiaryReference`\n\nAlso returns `paymentForm.organisationSnapshot` for any extra org fields."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create draft – Standing Order",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const form = json?.data?.paymentForm || json?.paymentForm;",
                  "if (form?._id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('paymentFormId', form._id);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('formType', form.formType || 'STANDING_ORDER');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"formType\": \"STANDING_ORDER\",\n  \"standingOrder\": {\n    \"debtorBankName\": \"AIB\",\n    \"debtorBankAddress\": \"1 Bank Centre, Dublin 2\",\n    \"debtorAccountName\": \"Jane Member\",\n    \"debtorIban\": \"IE29AIBK93115212345678\",\n    \"debtorBic\": \"AIBKIE2D\",\n    \"startDate\": \"2026-06-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"paymentFrequency\": \"Monthly\",\n    \"installmentAmountEur\": 45,\n    \"signatureDates\": [\n      \"2026-05-23T00:00:00.000Z\",\n      \"2026-05-23T00:00:00.000Z\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"gdpr\": {\n    \"consentCapturedAt\": \"2026-05-23T12:00:00.000Z\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/payment-forms/portal/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "payment-forms", "portal", ""]
            },
            "description": "Creates a hydrated draft.\n\n**Writable on create/PATCH:** standingOrder.debtor fields, startDate, paymentFrequency (default Monthly), installmentAmountEur (pre-calculated from subscription, editable), signatureDates[], gdpr.consentCapturedAt\n\n**Read-only (prefilled):** beneficiary/creditor fields, beneficiaryReference"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create draft – Salary Deduction",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const form = json?.data?.paymentForm || json?.paymentForm;",
                  "if (form?._id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('paymentFormId', form._id);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('formType', form.formType || 'SALARY_DEDUCTION');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"formType\": \"SALARY_DEDUCTION\",\n  \"salaryDeduction\": {\n    \"memberFullName\": \"JANE MEMBER\",\n    \"employedAt\": \"St James Hospital\",\n    \"payrollStaffNo\": \"12345\",\n    \"commencingDate\": \"2026-06-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"signedDate\": \"2026-05-23T00:00:00.000Z\"\n  },\n  \"gdpr\": {\n    \"consentCapturedAt\": \"2026-05-23T12:00:00.000Z\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/payment-forms/portal/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "payment-forms", "portal", ""]
            },
            "description": "**Required on submit:** memberFullName, employedAt (work location), payrollStaffNo, commencingDate\n\n**Writable:** salaryDeduction.memberFullName, employedAt, payrollStaffNo, commencingDate, signedDate, gdpr.consentCapturedAt\n\n**Read-only (prefilled):** referenceMembershipNo, installmentAmountEur, installmentAmountDisplay\n\n**IMPORTANT footer:** use `organisationSnapshot` (legalName/tradingName + bankAddress) from GET response"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create draft – Direct Debit (DD_MANDATE)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const form = json?.data?.paymentForm || json?.paymentForm;",
                  "if (form?._id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('paymentFormId', form._id);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('formType', form.formType || 'DD_MANDATE');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"formType\": \"DD_MANDATE\",\n  \"directDebitMandate\": {\n    \"debtorName\": \"Jane Member\",\n    \"debtorAddress\": \"1 Main Street\",\n    \"debtorCity\": \"Dublin\",\n    \"debtorPostcode\": \"D01 ABC1\",\n    \"debtorCountry\": \"Ireland\",\n    \"debtorIban\": \"IE29AIBK93115212345678\",\n    \"debtorBic\": \"AIBKIE2D\",\n    \"signedDate\": \"2026-05-23T00:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"isAuthorized\": true\n  },\n  \"gdpr\": {\n    \"consentCapturedAt\": \"2026-05-23T12:00:00.000Z\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/payment-forms/portal/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "payment-forms", "portal", ""]
            },
            "description": "**Writable:** directDebitMandate.debtorName, debtorAddress, debtorCity, debtorPostcode, debtorCountry, debtorIban, debtorBic, signedDate, isAuthorized, gdpr.consentCapturedAt\n\n**Read-only (prefilled):** directDebitMandate.creditorName, creditorIdentifier, creditorAddress, creditorCity, creditorPostcode, creditorCountry, uniqueMandateReference, paymentTypeRecurrent"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get form by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/payment-forms/portal/{{paymentFormId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "payment-forms", "portal", "{{paymentFormId}}"]
            },
            "description": "IBAN/BIC are masked on portal responses."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update – Standing Order",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
